# Tech Stack

## Core Technologies

### Web Framework

- **Next.js 15.4.3** - React framework with App Router
- **TypeScript 5.8.3** - Type-safe JavaScript

### Database

- **PostgreSQL** - Primary database
- **Prisma 6.12.0** - Database toolkit and ORM

### Environment & Configuration

- **@t3-oss/env-nextjs** - Type-safe environment variable validation
- **Zod 4.0.8** - Runtime validation and type safety

## Frontend

- **React 19.1.0** - UI library
- **TailwindCSS 4.1.11** - Utility-first CSS framework
- **PostCSS 8.5.6** - CSS post-processor

## GraphQL

- **GraphQL 16.11.0** - Query language and runtime
- **GraphQL Codegen 5.0.7** - Type-safe code generation

## Development Tools

- **pnpm 10.13.1** - Package manager
- **ESLint 9.31.0** - Code linting
- **Prettier 3.6.2** - Code formatting
- **prettier-plugin-tailwindcss** - Tailwind class sorting
- **lint-staged 16.1.2** - Pre-commit hooks
- **Husky 9.1.7** - Git hooks management
- **Commitlint** - Commit message linting

## Logging

- **pino 9.7.0** - High-performance structured logging
- **pino-pretty** - Development log formatting

## Testing

- **Vitest 3.2.4** - Unit testing framework
- **Testing Library** - Component testing utilities
- **jsdom 26.1.0** - DOM testing environment

## Utilities

- **slugify 1.6.6** - String slugification
- **server-only** - React server component utility

## Deployment & CI/CD

- **Docker** - Containerization
- **GitHub Actions** - CI/CD pipeline

## Environment

- **Node.js** - Runtime environment (>=20)
- **Environment Variables** - Type-safe .env configuration
